Package: MixSIARPFN
Title: Fast Bayesian Mixing Models with Prior-Data Fitted Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Andrew", "Parnell", email = "Andrew.parnell1@ucd.ie", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits the stable isotope mixing models of 'MixSIAR' (Stock et al. 2018,
    <doi:10.7717/peerj.5096>) from the same input files and with the same function
    calls, but obtains the marginal posterior distributions of the diet proportions
    and model parameters from prior-data fitted networks (transformer networks
    trained on simulations from the 'MixSIAR' model) instead of MCMC. Needs no
    'JAGS' and returns results in seconds.
License: GPL (>= 3)
